<!-- As-built 2026-11-11: plate 5 mm; boom centre 930 mm above plate; lens 550 mm forward of mast front; middle shelf top 230 mm above floor. C270 lens drop 60 mm is an unmeasured estimate. Mass/inertia are provisional; arm uses official new-calibration zero. MuJoCo self-contact is disabled and collision shapes are approximations. Isaac Sim runtime was not tested. -->

